{"item":{"key":"moment:1159108","id":"1159108","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"c782182a37eb4562669ac9f0"},"time":1616256000000,"text":"这可能是我自己最近人声处理最满意的歌没有之一了。哪怕经过音质压缩也很平衡，我很满意。[emot=acfun,1713/] 要以我以前的听感来说，这个可能有点干巴巴的。以前设备不好，只能通过很大的ktv混响来掩盖，逐渐形成了一些很不好的混音习惯。最近也在逐渐努力纠正过来。一些新生代插件，性能也超出过去想象的强大，我们也得自己不断跟进才行。 除了混音，声学方面也学习了一些新知识。努力降低了房混和机箱底噪，终于录出来自己满意的，干净的干音了。 什么叫每天都有新感受啊，我爱录音！ 最后感谢你看到这里，评论区请三位嚯奶茶！(关注五蕉哦~)[emot=acfun,1678/]","title":"","images":[],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":26,"likeCount":91,"bananaCount":83,"shareCount":0},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/1159108","timePrecision":"day","source":{"key":"video:27025789","id":"27025789","kind":"video","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"c782182a37eb4562669ac9f0"},"time":1616292060503,"text":"","title":"【超好听的一首中V】「蒸汽金鱼」（影子小姐同系列作品）","images":[],"cover":"6d7a56de2dedf40d0931fee0","duration":"03:53","views":35530,"counts":{"commentCount":396,"likeCount":5091,"bananaCount":25727,"shareCount":101},"url":"https://www.acfun.cn/v/ac27025789"},"commentsPending":false,"archivedComments":26,"archivedRoots":23,"threads":{"417573491":{"pages":["comments/1159108/threads/417573491/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"417573491","root":"417573491","user":{"id":"312766","name":"降龙罗汉小喵喵","avatar":"2fdc41003dcd8acf79dcfed7"},"text":"肥肠粉行不行[emot=acfun,1701/][emot=acfun,1701/]","time":1616299896874,"floor":14,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}},"417556478":{"pages":["comments/1159108/threads/417556478/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"417556478","root":"417556478","user":{"id":"216299","name":"乌衣睡不着","avatar":"55bede6e2dda2e307b0a7423"},"text":"优秀啊，水姐[emot=acfun,1708/][emot=acfun,1708/][emot=acfun,1708/]\n很佩服这种进取的态度，我也要加油[emot=acfun,1815/]","time":1616297283840,"floor":3